# NOTICE — Third-Party Software

This software includes the following third-party components.

## ffmpeg

The Docker image installs `ffmpeg` via `apt-get install -y ffmpeg` (Debian build).
The Debian `ffmpeg` package is built with LGPL/GPL components.  ytt does not
modify ffmpeg; it is a separate binary invoked by yt-dlp for audio remuxing.

- License: LGPL 2.1+ / GPL 2+ (Debian build)
- Source: https://ffmpeg.org/
- Debian package: https://packages.debian.org/ffmpeg

This is "mere aggregation" — ytt's code does not link against or incorporate
ffmpeg source code.  The ffmpeg license terms apply to ffmpeg itself, not to ytt.

## yt-dlp

yt-dlp is used as a Python library (not a subprocess) for caption and audio
extraction.

- License: Unlicense (public domain)
- Source: https://github.com/yt-dlp/yt-dlp

## FastMCP

FastMCP provides the MCP server framework.

